  "description": "An internet meme trope that involves portraying a person, often male, as overly affectionate, emotionally manipulative, or submissive, using the 'uwu' emoticon (a stylized representation of a cute or childish expression). It is frequently used to mock or stereotype individuals who are perceived as 'toxic' or 'emotional' in online communities, particularly in gaming or anime fandoms.",
